WEBVTT

00:01:27.439 --> 00:01:30.338
I couldn't keep watching my oldest son

00:01:30.338 --> 00:01:31.763
make bad choices

00:01:31.763 --> 00:01:34.458
without being able to be there for him

00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:38.241
when and if he needed me.

00:01:38.241 --> 00:01:41.755
But the real change came more gradually.

00:01:41.755 --> 00:01:43.514
Over the next year,

00:01:43.514 --> 00:01:46.389
while my family was righting itself,

00:01:46.389 --> 00:01:48.053
I started to realize

00:01:48.053 --> 00:01:50.992
that even if I could go back into government,

00:01:50.992 --> 00:01:52.772
I didn't want to.

00:01:52.772 --> 00:01:56.719
I didn't want to miss the last five years

00:01:56.719 --> 00:01:59.551
that my sons were at home.

00:01:59.551 --> 00:02:03.437
I finally allowed myself to accept